	keywords = {Transcription Factors, Humans, Prostate, Male, Prostatic Neoplasms, Lung Neoplasms, Biomarkers, Tumor, Female, Acetylation, Histones, Lysine, Breast Neoplasms, Phosphatidylinositol 3-Kinases, DNA Methylation, Promoter Regions, Genetic, DNA-Binding Proteins, Chromatin Immunoprecipitation, Enhancer of Zeste Homolog 2 Protein, CpG Islands, Alkaline Phosphatase, Cells, Cultured, Colony-Forming Units Assay, Gene Silencing, Microarray Analysis, Microfilament Proteins, Polycomb Repressive Complex 2, Reverse Transcriptase Polymerase Chain Reaction, RNA, Messenger},
